 [(0,1),(2,3)]   | 2.8284271247461903 | (1,2)     | f    | f
 [(1,1),(1,1)]   |                  0 | (1,1)     | t    | t
 [(-1,-1),(3,3)] |  5.656854249492381 | (1,1)     | f    | f
 [(2,2),(4,4)]   | 2.8284271247461903 | (3,3)     | f    | f
 [(0,3),(3,0)]   |  4.242640687119286 | (1.5,1.5) | f    | f
